@policy_null
title: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: policy

@discipline
title: Practice budget discipline
subtitle: Cut salaries and benefits across the government. 
unavailable-subtitle: There is nothing left to cut.
choose-if: efficacy_finance > 0.25
on-arrival: efficacy_finance -= 0.1; efficacy_foreign -= 0.1; efficacy_military -= 0.1; efficacy_enlightenment -= 0.1; efficacy_internal -= 0.1; efficacy_railways -= 0.1; efficacy_trade -= 0.1; efficacy_justice -= 0.1; efficacy_agriculture -= 0.1; efficacy_foodsupply -= 0.1; efficacy_nationalities -= 0.1; efficacy_welfare -= 0.1; foreignaffairs_expend -= 0.25; military_expend -= 0.25; enlightenment_expend -= 0.25; railways_expend -= 0.25; trade_expend -= 0.25; finance_expend -= 0.25; justice_expend -= 0.25; labor_expend -= 0.25; agriculture_expend -= 0.25; foodsupply_expend -= 0.25; nationalities_expend -= 0.25; welfare_expend -= 0.25; monthly_inflation -= 0.1; investor_confidence += 0.02;

Cutting the budget hurts the workers and middle class, and also reduces the morale of the soldiers and railroad workers, two of the largest groups of government employees. This makes them less effective at their jobs.

@raise_salaries
title: Raise salary rates
subtitle: Raise salaries for government employees.
on-arrival: efficacy_finance += 0.15 if efficacy_finance < 1; efficacy_foreign += 0.15 if efficacy_foreign < 1; efficacy_military += 0.15 if efficacy_military < 1; efficacy_enlightenment += 0.15 if efficacy_enlightenment < 1; efficacy_internal += 0.15 if efficacy_internal < 1; efficacy_railways += 0.15 if efficacy_railways < 1; efficacy_trade += 0.15 if efficacy_trade < 1; efficacy_justice += 0.15 if efficacy_justice < 1; efficacy_agriculture += 0.15 if efficacy_agriculture < 1; efficacy_foodsupply += 0.15 if efficacy_foodsupply < 1; efficacy_nationalities += 0.15 if efficacy_nationalities < 1; efficacy_welfare += 0.15 if efficacy_welfare < 1; foreignaffairs_expend += 0.25; military_expend += 0.25; enlightenment_expend += 0.25; railways_expend += 0.25; trade_expend += 0.25; finance_expend += 0.25; justice_expend += 0.25; labor_expend += 0.25; agriculture_expend += 0.25; foodsupply_expend += 0.25; nationalities_expend += 0.25; welfare_expend += 0.25; monthly_inflation += 0.05; capital_flight_progress -= 0.5;



@tax_census
title: Conduct a census of taxpayers.
subtitle: -[+ census_cost +] resources – Register incomes and property across the country.[? if tax_inspectors > 0 : <br>Our tax inspectors have lowered the cost of the census. ?]
choose-if: tax_census_timer = 0 and resources >= census_cost
unavailable-subtitle: [? if tax_census_timer != 0 : The last census is still being compiled. ?][? if tax_census_timer = 0 : -[+ census_cost +] resources – We lack the resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= Q.census_cost;
  Q.tax_administration = Math.min(1, Q.tax_administration + 0.1 * (0.5 + Q.finalefficacy_finance / 2));
  Q.tax_census_timer = 12;
  Q.middle_unrest += 1; Q.kulaks_unrest += 1;
!}

@hire_tax_inspectors
title: Hire tax inspectors.
subtitle: -0.25 resources – Raises tax administration, at the cost of higher spending.
choose-if: resources >= 0.25 and tax_inspectors < 8
unavailable-subtitle: [? if tax_inspectors >= 8 : We cannot staff any more inspectorates. ?][? if tax_inspectors < 8 : -0.25 resources – We lack the resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.25;
  Q.tax_inspectors += 1;
  Q.finance_expend += 0.25;
  Q.tax_administration = Math.min(1, Q.tax_administration + 0.05);
!}

@dismiss_tax_inspectors
title: Dismiss tax inspectors.
subtitle: Lowers spending, but weakens tax administration.
view-if: tax_inspectors > 0
on-arrival: {!
  Q.tax_inspectors -= 1;
  Q.finance_expend = Math.max(0.1, Q.finance_expend - 0.25);
  Q.tax_administration = Math.max(0, Q.tax_administration - 0.05);
!}

@tax_withholding_on
title: Withhold income tax from wages at source.
subtitle: State enterprises will deduct taxes before paying their workers.
view-if: tax_withholding = 0
choose-if: industries_nationalized >= 20
unavailable-subtitle: Too little of industry is in state hands to make this worthwhile.
on-arrival: {!
  Q.tax_withholding = 1;
  Q.workers_unrest += 5 * (Q.industries_nationalized / 100) + 2;
!}

@tax_withholding_off
title: End withholding at source.
view-if: tax_withholding = 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.tax_withholding = 0;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 2;
!}

@tax_indexation_on
title: Index tax assessments to prices.
subtitle: Taxes are reassessed as prices rise, halving the losses from inflation.
view-if: tax_indexation = 0
on-arrival: {!
  Q.tax_indexation = 1;
  Q.middle_unrest += 3; Q.elites_unrest += 3; Q.kulaks_unrest += 2;
  Q.investor_confidence = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, Q.investor_confidence - 0.02));
!}

@tax_indexation_off
title: Return to fixed tax assessments.
view-if: tax_indexation = 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.tax_indexation = 0;
  Q.middle_unrest -= 2; Q.elites_unrest -= 2; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 1;
  Q.investor_confidence = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, Q.investor_confidence + 0.01));
!}

@tax_collection_drive
title: [? if cheka_founded = 1 : Send the Cheka to collect arrears. ?][? if cheka_founded != 1 : Send the Red Guard to collect arrears. ?]
subtitle: By using force, we can ensure a temporary surge in collection.
choose-if: tax_collection_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The last collection drive is still underway.
on-arrival: {!
  Q.tax_enforcement = (Q.tax_enforcement || 0) + 0.1 + Q.cheka_collection_bonus;
  Q.tax_collection_timer = 8;
  Q.elites_unrest += 5; Q.middle_unrest += 4; Q.kulaks_unrest += 4; Q.peasants_unrest += 2;
  Q.instability += 1; Q.capital_flight_progress += 0.25;
  Q.investor_confidence = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, Q.investor_confidence - 0.04));
!}

@tax_amnesty
title: Declare an amnesty on unpaid taxes.
subtitle: +[+ amnesty_yield +] resources – Evaders settle their arrears, but learn to wait for the next amnesty.
choose-if: tax_amnesty_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: An amnesty so soon would be meaningless.
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources += Q.amnesty_yield;
  Q.tax_amnesties += 1;
  Q.tax_amnesty_timer = 26;
  Q.tax_administration = Math.max(0, Q.tax_administration - 0.03);
  Q.middle_unrest -= 3; Q.elites_unrest -= 3; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 2;
  Q.workers_unrest += 1;
  Q.investor_confidence = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, Q.investor_confidence + 0.03));
!}


@taxation
title: TAXATION
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
  var income_efficacy = (Q.income_tax_efficacy / 4 * 3) + (Q.finalefficacy_finance / 4);
  Q.income_tax_estimate = 0;
  for (var bracket = 1; bracket <= 5; bracket++) {
      var estimate = (Q['income_tax_yield_' + bracket] || 0) * Q['income_tax_rate_' + bracket] * income_efficacy;
      Q['income_tax_' + bracket + '_display'] = Math.round(100 * estimate)/100;
      Q.income_tax_estimate += estimate;
  }
  Q.income_tax_estimate = Math.round(100 * Q.income_tax_estimate)/100;
  Q.property_tax_estimate = Math.round(100 * (Q.property_tax_yield || 0) * Q.wealth_tax_rate)/100;
  Q.business_tax_estimate = Math.round(100 * (Q.business_tax_yield || 0) * Q.business_tax_rate)/100;
  Q.syndicate_levy_estimate = Math.round(100 * (Q.syndicate_levy_yield || 0) * Q.syndicate_levy_rate)/100;
  Q.taxation_estimate = Math.round(100 * (Q.income_tax_estimate + Q.property_tax_estimate + Q.business_tax_estimate + Q.syndicate_levy_estimate))/100;
!}

